WebDecoy web-bot-auth (Go)
Copyright 2026 WebDecoy

This product is a Go implementation of the Web Bot Auth protocol
(draft-meunier-webbotauth-httpsig-protocol), ported from and
cross-validated against cloudflare/web-bot-auth
(https://github.com/cloudflare/web-bot-auth), which is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Test vectors under testdata/ and
thumbprint/testdata/ are copied verbatim from that repository.
